# .dclintrc — dclint configuration. Severity: 0 disabled, 1 warning, 2 error.
#
# no-build-and-image is disabled. The Compose specification explicitly allows both keys
# together: `build` says how to build, `image` says what to tag the result. That is
# exactly our case for the two locally built linting images.
#
# Keeping the names is not cosmetic. A developer working on a dozen projects with nearly
# identical compose files ends up with a screenful of containers; images called
# tpo42/asciidoc-linter and tpo42/mini-qa are findable, generated names are not. The
# names are also the ones these images will be published under once they leave the
# technical-debt stage, so dropping them now would only mean reinstating them later.
rules:
  no-build-and-image: 0
